        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/40709996/\n1\n\nFor the Petitioners : M/s. A. K. Kashyap, Sr. Advocate For the State : M/s. Subodh Kumar Dubey,\nA.P.P\n---\n04/12.06.2024 Heard the Parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1246,
      "end": 1442,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "A. K. Kashyap",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1331,
          "end": 1344
        },
        {
          "text": "Subodh Kumar Dubey",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1380,
          "end": 1398
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "Petitioners are apprehending their arrest in connection with Ramgarh P. S. Case No. 09/2022,\nregistered under Sections 147/ 148/ 149/ 323/ 325/ 376-D/ 506 of the Indian Penal Code, pending in the Court of learned A.C.J.M., Palamau at Daltonganj.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1443,
      "end": 1689,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramgarh P. S. Case No. 09/2022",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1505,
          "end": 1535
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 147/",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1554,
          "end": 1567
        },
        {
          "text": "148/",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1568,
          "end": 1572
        },
        {
          "text": "149/",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1573,
          "end": 1577
        },
        {
          "text": "323/",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1578,
          "end": 1582
        },
        {
          "text": "325/",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1583,
          "end": 1587
        },
        {
          "text": "376-D/",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1588,
          "end": 1594
        },
        {
          "text": "506",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1595,
          "end": 1598
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Penal Code",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1606,
          "end": 1623
        },
        {
          "text": "A.C.J.M., Palamau at Daltonganj",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1657,
          "end": 1688
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Case diary earlier called for has been received, perused the same.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1690,
      "end": 1757,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0725213959813118
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "It is alleged that on 29.01.2022, the petitioners alongwith other accused persons at about 5:30 P.M.\nstarted chasing the victim, she was also disrobed and assaulted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1758,
      "end": 1924,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "29.01.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1781,
          "end": 1791
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18880847096443176
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "From the perusal of the statement of the witnesses recorded in the case diary, it appears that the victim was mentally disabled.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1925,
      "end": 2053,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17447145283222198
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "There was function in the village and the victim started spitting on the food and other items kept at the venue, when the villagers stopped her, she started fleeing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2054,
      "end": 2219,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2354627251625061
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "The witnesses have also stated that after 10 minutes she again came back from her house in a naked condition after which the villagers caught hold of her and tried to put clothes on her body.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2220,
      "end": 2411,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11158156394958496
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "It further appears from the perusal of the injury report that the victim had sustained two abrasions on her body which are simple in nature.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2412,
      "end": 2553,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13392148911952972
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "Learned Senior counsel appearing on behalf of the petitioners submitted that the entire village has been implicated in this case and the victim has sustained abrasions as the villagers had tried to catch her when she was spitting on food and other items.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2554,
      "end": 2809,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1740177422761917
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "Regard being had to the facts and circumstance of the case; I am inclined to extend the privilege of Anticipatory Bail to them.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2810,
      "end": 2938,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1225353330373764
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "They are directed to surrender before the court below within two weeks from the date of receipt of copy of this order and learned court below on their surrender shall release them on bail on furnishing bail bonds of Rs. 25,000/- (Twenty five Thousand only) each with two sureties of the like amount each to the satisfaction of learned A.C.J.M., Palamau at Daltonganj in connection with Ramgarh P. S. Case No. 09/2022,",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2939,
      "end": 3356,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Palamau",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3284,
          "end": 3291
        },
        {
          "text": "Daltonganj",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3295,
          "end": 3305
        },
        {
          "text": "Ramgarh P. S. Case No. 09/2022",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3325,
          "end": 3355
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07074293494224548
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "Subject to the conditions as laid down under Section 438 (2) Cr.P.C.\n(Ambuj Nath, J.) Saurabh Uploaded Tulsi Munda vs The State Of Jharkhand ... ...",
